    "details": "<p><strong>About the Competition</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Vihaan X is North India's largest student-run hackathon, organised by IEEE DTU.</li>\n<li>The Software Track is a celebration of innovation through code, where participants collaborate to build impactful digital solutions in an intense 24-hour window.</li>\n<li>The format is structured as 8 hours of coding, 8 hours of building, and 8 hours of debugging &mdash; pushing teams to turn ideas into fully functional applications.</li>\n<li>From AI-powered platforms and full-stack web apps to mobile and system-level solutions, this track is where ambitious builders ship real products, not just prototypes.</li>\n<li>Teams design scalable, user-centric solutions while getting mentored by industry experts throughout the event.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Software Track Domains</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>HealthTech</li>\n<li>FinTech</li>\n<li>Education</li>\n<li>Web3 &amp; Blockchain</li>\n<li>E-Sports</li>\n<li>Women's Safety</li>\n<li>Security</li>\n<li>Sustainability</li>\n<li>Open Innovation</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Team Size</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Maximum of 4 participants per team.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Rounds:&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Day 1:</strong>&nbsp;Building and developing projects, from core features to a working prototype</li>\n<li><strong>Day 2 (around 10 AM):</strong> Project evaluation and judging</li>\n<li><strong>Final Round:</strong> Shortlisted teams present to industry experts</li>\n<li>Winners are announced after final presentations</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Learning Opportunities</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Direct mentorship from industry experts throughout the event</li>\n<li>Exposure to modern tools, frameworks, and development practices</li>\n<li>Hands-on experience building real-world software solutions from scratch</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Rewards &amp; Opportunity</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Exciting cash prizes and exclusive rewards for winning teams</li>\n<li>Recognition for the most innovative and impactful solutions</li>\n<li>A collaborative environment that fuels creativity, learning, and execution &mdash; 24 hours to code, build, and ship something that matters</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Venue:</strong> Delhi Technological University</p>\n<p><strong>WhatsApp Group: </strong><a href=\"https://chat.whatsapp.com/LhXp4DQOVgEIP6yxeeY37V\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">https://chat.whatsapp.com/LhXp4DQOVgEIP6yxeeY37V</span></a></p>",
